# Imports & Lint Gate

## Path alias (required)

- Cross-folder imports: **`@/*`** — never `../../*` or deeper (ESLint `no-restricted-imports` **error**).
- Within the same feature entity: relative `./` and `../` OK (e.g. `../core/schema`, `./chuc-vu-form`).
- Repair bulk debt: `node scripts/fix-deep-imports.mjs` · regression check: `npm run lint:imports:check`.

## Before merge

```bash
npm run lint:ci   # eslint . --max-warnings 0
npm run test
npm run build
```

Pre-commit runs `lint-staged` on staged `*.{ts,tsx}` only.

